ValidateBlockModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Validates a single IR block: checks presence and types of id/instrs/term and runs each instruction through ValidateInstr. Returns 1 on success, 0 on violation.
    Provides: ValidateBlock(block) -> ok.
    DependsOn: ValidateInstr, ValidateTerm.
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../ValidateBlock/ValidateBlock.sir).
